[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4260521609","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118634#issuecomment-4260521609","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118634","id":4260521609,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc798maJ","user":{"login":"kleonc","id":9283098,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkyODMwOTg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9283098?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc","html_url":"https://github.com/kleonc","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-16T13:43:08Z","updated_at":"2026-04-16T13:43:08Z","body":"Seems the drag is not being interrupted/reset on focus lost, this can lead to incorrect state. To see it in action\r\n(tested on Windows 10):\r\n\r\n1. Start drag-toggling the visibility buttons by LMB press.\r\n2. <kbd>Alt+Tab</kbd> to another app.\r\n3. LMB release.\r\n4. <kbd>Alt+Tab</kbd> back to Godot.\r\n5. Hover the mouse over the visibility buttons, it's still in drag-toggling state (with mouse not pressed anymore).","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4260521609/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4260537945","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118634#issuecomment-4260537945","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118634","id":4260537945,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc798qZZ","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-16T13:45:24Z","updated_at":"2026-04-16T13:45:24Z","body":"On that note, maybe there should be a way to cancel the drag? Like RMB or Escape.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4260537945/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4261237668","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118634#issuecomment-4261237668","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118634","id":4261237668,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc79_VOk","user":{"login":"mihe","id":4884246,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4ODQyNDY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4884246?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe","html_url":"https://github.com/mihe","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-16T15:20:43Z","updated_at":"2026-04-16T15:20:43Z","body":"> Seems the drag is not being interrupted/reset on focus lost, this can lead to incorrect state.\r\n\r\nFixed (?) by resetting the drag state on `NOTIFICATION_APPLICATION_FOCUS_OUT`/`NOTIFICATION_WM_WINDOW_FOCUS_OUT`.\r\n\r\n> On that note, maybe there should be a way to cancel the drag? Like RMB or Escape.\r\n\r\nI assume `ui_cancel` is meant to do that kind of thing, and seems to be what `Viewport` uses to stop its dragging as well, so I just copied what it was doing. `Viewport` does however not respect `ui_cancel` when bound to a mouse button, which seems like it might be a bug, but I copied it anyway.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4261237668/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4261354059","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118634#issuecomment-4261354059","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118634","id":4261354059,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc79_xpL","user":{"login":"mihe","id":4884246,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4ODQyNDY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4884246?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe","html_url":"https://github.com/mihe","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-16T15:37:12Z","updated_at":"2026-04-16T15:37:12Z","body":"> On that note, maybe there should be a way to cancel the drag? Like RMB or Escape.\r\n\r\nIt turned out that `Viewport` was in fact stopping its dragging on RMB [as well](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/a6ed51df17a2afce9459cf9f46ded0baac79b9cb/scene/main/viewport.cpp#L1939-L1943) (which perhaps was why you suggested it) so I threw that in as well.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4261354059/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4309557326","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118634#issuecomment-4309557326","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118634","id":4309557326,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABAN6gTg","user":{"login":"keestak","id":129698499,"node_id":"U_kgDOB7sKww","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/129698499?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/keestak","html_url":"https://github.com/keestak","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keestak/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keestak/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keestak/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keestak/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keestak/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keestak/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keestak/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keestak/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keestak/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-24T00:29:49Z","updated_at":"2026-04-24T00:29:49Z","body":"This pr looks good, I included the extra api for a generic click and drag in my own pr because it was requested in the issue I linked and this doesn't, but it's probably cleaner as a result. I'll close my pr since this one supersedes it. ","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4309557326/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4782931018","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118634#issuecomment-4782931018","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118634","id":4782931018,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABHRW8Sg","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-23T19:55:23Z","updated_at":"2026-06-23T19:55:23Z","body":"Thanks!","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4782931018/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4786806742","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118634#issuecomment-4786806742","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118634","id":4786806742,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABHVDf1g","user":{"login":"mihe","id":4884246,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4ODQyNDY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4884246?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe","html_url":"https://github.com/mihe","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-24T07:15:44Z","updated_at":"2026-06-24T07:15:44Z","body":"I should probably mention one potential bug related to this, which is that I had a report from a client of ours that they experienced missed inputs as they were dragging along the visibility icons, causing only some of them to be toggled.\r\n\r\nHere's the recording they shared with us:\r\n\r\n<img width=\"500\" height=\"320\" alt=\"missed_inputs\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/3b4df8a5-b884-4def-b8ac-46ffd826745d\" />\r\n\r\nThis is on macOS, with this change cherrypicked to 4.6.2, in a larger project. I haven't had time/ability to really dig into what's going on exactly, in large part because I wasn't able to reproduce it myself (on macOS and Linux/X11). I assume from the approvals here that nobody else ran into this when testing either.\r\n\r\nThis could probably be rewritten fairly easily to be more along the lines of a marquee selection, meaning you'd always toggle everything between the start node and the current node with every registered visibility button overlap, but I wanted to make sure it's not something that should be fixed on the input side of things (or their project specifically) first.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4786806742/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":3},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6328550987","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118634#issuecomment-6328550987","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118634","id":6328550987,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABeTYGSw","user":{"login":"Gedudo","id":124629446,"node_id":"U_kgDOB22xxg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/124629446?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gedudo","html_url":"https://github.com/Gedudo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gedudo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gedudo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gedudo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gedudo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gedudo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gedudo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gedudo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gedudo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gedudo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-21T23:06:46Z","updated_at":"2026-10-21T23:06:46Z","body":"Hi, I wish to comment from my testing of Godot 4.8 Beta 1 that I think the Gizmos visibility drop-down would greatly benefit from having this functionality. \r\n\r\n<img width=\"733\" height=\"1099\" alt=\"Gizmo visibility drop-down\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/4067663d-3d3d-4a01-97bb-2fe6a044b9e7\" />\r\n\r\nIt was also [mentioned](https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/5488) in one of the feature requests that were closed in relevance to this PR.","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6328550987/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]